                        doom/ — LICENSES & ATTRIBUTION
                        =============================

This directory ships two independently-licensed bodies of work:

  FILE            LICENSE         UPSTREAM SOURCE
  doom.js     ]
  doom.wasm   ]-- GNU GPL v2      cloudflare/doom-wasm @ 65e0d3ae  (see §1)
  default.cfg ]                   (Chocolate Doom, SDL2)
  freedm.wad  --- BSD-3-Clause    FreeDoom 0.13.0, freedm.wad      (see §2)

Full provenance, sha256s and the fetch/rebuild recipe are in this directory's
README.md and BUILD.md (BUILD.md is not publicly served; this COPYING is).

